# GetNextSPL — pick-loop entry point. PEEK ONLY. Returns the first occupied
# slot whose SPL state matches the requested state, scanned in a statically
# configured ascending/descending slot-index order (~ascending_order param
# on the ROS1 node).
# Mirror of yumi_ros/storage_system/srv/GetNextSPL.srv (ROS1) — keep in sync.

string state
---
storage_system/SPL spl
int32 slot
bool found
storage_system/Result result
